{"seq":2,"slug":"legacy-migration-patterns","title":"遗留代码迁移模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/practice/legacy-migration-patterns","wordCount":1268,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"遗留代码迁移模式\">遗留代码迁移模式</h1><p>大多数移动应用不是从零开始的绿地项目——它们是在一个已有数十万行代码、数百个屏幕、缺乏测试覆盖的 monolith 基础上逐步演进的。直接重写（Big Bang Rewrite）在移动端的失败率极高：Airbnb 2018 年放弃 React Native 重写、Twitter 2023 年的 iOS 重写延期一年。渐进迁移（Strangler Fig Pattern）是唯一被大规模验证有效的策略——新代码用新架构，旧代码按优先级逐步替换，两者在过渡期共存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Strangler Fig 模式</strong>：新代码用新架构、旧代码按优先级逐步替换、路由层作为绞杀接缝——渐进替换而非 Big Bang 重写</li>\n<li><strong>迁移优先级矩阵</strong>：按变更频率 × 技术债务严重度评估，高频高债务的页面优先迁移</li>\n<li><strong>Characterization Test</strong>：重构前先写测试捕捉旧代码当前行为，确保重构不改变可观察行为</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"strangler-fig-模式在移动端的适配\">Strangler Fig 模式在移动端的适配</h2><p>Martin Fowler 在 2004 年描述的 Strangler Fig Pattern 原本用于后端微服务迁移。移动端的适配要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>路由层作为绞杀接缝</strong>：导航请求先经过路由层，路由层决定跳转到新页面（SwiftUI/Compose）还是旧页面（UIKit/XML）</li>\n<li><strong>渐进替换而非并行维护两套</strong>：每次只迁移一个屏幕/Feature，迁移完成后删除旧实现</li>\n<li><strong>功能对等验证</strong>：新实现必须通过旧实现的所有手动 QA Case + 新增的自动化测试</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 过渡期架构&#10;        Router[路由层&lt;br/&gt;统一入口] --&gt;|新页面| New[新架构&lt;br/&gt;Compose/SwiftUI + MVVM/MVI]&#10;        Router --&gt;|旧页面| Legacy[遗留代码&lt;br/&gt;Activity/UIViewController + MVC]&#10;    end&#10;    User[用户请求] --&gt; Router\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 过渡期架构\n        Router[路由层&lt;br/&gt;统一入口] --&gt;|新页面| New[新架构&lt;br/&gt;Compose/SwiftUI + MVVM/MVI]\n        Router --&gt;|旧页面| Legacy[遗留代码&lt;br/&gt;Activity/UIViewController + MVC]\n    end\n    User[用户请求] --&gt; Router</pre><h2 id=\"迁移优先级矩阵\">迁移优先级矩阵</h2><p>不是所有页面都值得立即迁移。用两个维度评估：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>迁移优先级</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>变更频率</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>技术债务严重度</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{迁移优先级} = \\text{变更频率} \\times \\text{技术债务严重度}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">迁移优先级</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">变更频率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">技术债务严重度</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>象限</th>\n<th>变更频率</th>\n<th>技术债务</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高频 + 高债务</td>\n<td>每周</td>\n<td>Massive VC、无测试</td>\n<td><strong>立即迁移</strong>——最高 ROI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高频 + 低债务</td>\n<td>每周</td>\n<td>结构尚可</td>\n<td>逐步重构，不必完整重写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低频 + 高债务</td>\n<td>每季度</td>\n<td>无人敢碰</td>\n<td>标记为&quot;迁移时重写&quot;，暂不动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低频 + 低债务</td>\n<td>每年</td>\n<td>稳定运行</td>\n<td><strong>不迁移</strong>——如果没坏别修</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"六种渐进迁移模式\">六种渐进迁移模式</h2><h3 id=\"模式-1-分支抽象-branch-by-abstraction\">模式 1：分支抽象（Branch by Abstraction）</h3><p>在旧代码和新代码之间插入一个接口层，两种实现共存，通过 Feature Flag 切换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 接口层&#10;interface CheckoutFlow {&#10;    fun start(cart: Cart)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 旧实现&#10;class LegacyCheckoutFlow : CheckoutFlow {&#10;    override fun start(cart: Cart) {&#10;        // 启动旧的 Activity 链&#10;        context.startActivity(Intent(context, LegacyCheckoutActivity::class.java))&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 新实现&#10;class ModernCheckoutFlow @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val navigator: AppNavigator&#10;) : CheckoutFlow {&#10;    override fun start(cart: Cart) {&#10;        navigator.navigateToCheckout(cart.id)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Feature Flag 切换&#10;@Provides&#10;fun provideCheckoutFlow(&#10;    featureFlags: FeatureFlags,&#10;    modern: ModernCheckoutFlow,&#10;    legacy: LegacyCheckoutFlow&#10;): CheckoutFlow = if (featureFlags.isModernCheckout) modern else legacy\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 接口层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface CheckoutFlow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun start(cart: Cart)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 旧实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class LegacyCheckoutFlow : CheckoutFlow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun start(cart: Cart) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 启动旧的 Activity 链</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        context.startActivity(Intent(context, LegacyCheckoutActivity::class.java))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 新实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ModernCheckoutFlow @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val navigator: AppNavigator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : CheckoutFlow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun start(cart: Cart) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        navigator.navigateToCheckout(cart.id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Feature Flag 切换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun provideCheckoutFlow(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    featureFlags: FeatureFlags,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modern: ModernCheckoutFlow,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    legacy: LegacyCheckoutFlow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>): CheckoutFlow = if (featureFlags.isModernCheckout) modern else legacy</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模式-2-wrapper-adapter-层\">模式 2：Wrapper / Adapter 层</h3><p>将旧模块包装为新架构可消费的接口，而不立即重写内部实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 旧的 Objective-C 网络层&#10;@objc class LegacyNetworkManager: NSObject {&#10;    @objc func fetchOrders(completion: @escaping ([NSDictionary]?, NSError?) -&gt; Void) { ... }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Swift async/await Adapter&#10;struct OrderNetworkAdapter: OrderRemoteDataSource {&#10;    private let legacy = LegacyNetworkManager()&#10;&#10;    func getOrders() async throws -&gt; [OrderDto] {&#10;        try await withCheckedThrowingContinuation { continuation in&#10;            legacy.fetchOrders { dicts, error in&#10;                if let error { continuation.resume(throwing: error) }&#10;                else { continuation.resume(returning: dicts?.compactMap(OrderDto.init) ?? []) }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 旧的 Objective-C 网络层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@objc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LegacyNetworkManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NSObject </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @objc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchOrders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">completion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@escaping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ([NSDictionary]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, NSError</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Swift async/await Adapter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderNetworkAdapter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">OrderRemoteDataSource </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> legacy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LegacyNetworkManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getOrders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [OrderDto] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        try</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> withCheckedThrowingContinuation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { continuation </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            legacy.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fetchOrders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { dicts, error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error { continuation.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">resume</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">throwing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: error) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { continuation.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">resume</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">returning</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: dicts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">compactMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(OrderDto.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模式-3-ui-层渐进替换\">模式 3：UI 层渐进替换</h3><p>在同一屏幕内混合新旧 UI 框架：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// Android：在 Activity 中嵌入 Compose&#10;class LegacyOrderActivity : AppCompatActivity() {&#10;    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {&#10;        // 旧的 XML 布局保持不变&#10;        setContentView(R.layout.activity_order)&#10;&#10;        // 新功能用 ComposeView 嵌入&#10;        val composeContainer = findViewById&lt;ComposeView&gt;(R.id.compose_recommendation)&#10;        composeContainer.setContent {&#10;            RecommendationWidget(viewModel = hiltViewModel())&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Android：在 Activity 中嵌入 Compose</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class LegacyOrderActivity : AppCompatActivity() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 旧的 XML 布局保持不变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        setContentView(R.layout.activity_order)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 新功能用 ComposeView 嵌入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val composeContainer = findViewById&#x3C;ComposeView>(R.id.compose_recommendation)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composeContainer.setContent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            RecommendationWidget(viewModel = hiltViewModel())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// iOS：在 UIKit 中嵌入 SwiftUI&#10;class LegacyOrderViewController: UIViewController {&#10;    override func viewDidLoad() {&#10;        super.viewDidLoad()&#10;&#10;        // 新功能用 UIHostingController 嵌入&#10;        let swiftUIView = RecommendationView()&#10;        let hosting = UIHostingController(rootView: swiftUIView)&#10;        addChild(hosting)&#10;        view.addSubview(hosting.view)&#10;        hosting.didMove(toParent: self)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// iOS：在 UIKit 中嵌入 SwiftUI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LegacyOrderViewController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UIViewController </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    override</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> viewDidLoad</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">viewDidLoad</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 新功能用 UIHostingController 嵌入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> swiftUIView </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> RecommendationView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hosting </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> UIHostingController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rootView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: swiftUIView)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        addChild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(hosting)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        view.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">addSubview</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(hosting.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">view</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        hosting.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">didMove</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">toParent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模式-4-数据层先行\">模式 4：数据层先行</h3><p>先迁移数据层（Repository + 数据源），UI 层暂时不动。这是风险最低的起步方式：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;阶段1:数据层迁移&quot;&#10;        OldUI[&quot;旧 UI 层&lt;br/&gt;保持不变&quot;] --&gt; NewRepo[&quot;新 Repository&lt;br/&gt;Clean Architecture&quot;]&#10;        NewRepo --&gt; NewRemote[&quot;新网络层&lt;br/&gt;Ktor/URLSession async&quot;]&#10;        NewRepo --&gt; NewLocal[&quot;新本地存储&lt;br/&gt;Room/SwiftData&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;阶段2:Presentation 层迁移&quot;&#10;        NewUI[&quot;新 UI&lt;br/&gt;Compose/SwiftUI&quot;] --&gt; NewRepo&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph \"阶段1:数据层迁移\"\n        OldUI[\"旧 UI 层&lt;br/&gt;保持不变\"] --&gt; NewRepo[\"新 Repository&lt;br/&gt;Clean Architecture\"]\n        NewRepo --&gt; NewRemote[\"新网络层&lt;br/&gt;Ktor/URLSession async\"]\n        NewRepo --&gt; NewLocal[\"新本地存储&lt;br/&gt;Room/SwiftData\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"阶段2:Presentation 层迁移\"\n        NewUI[\"新 UI&lt;br/&gt;Compose/SwiftUI\"] --&gt; NewRepo\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"模式-5-特性冻结-平行开发\">模式 5：特性冻结 + 平行开发</h3><p>对遗留模块冻结新功能开发（只修 Bug），所有新功能在新架构中开发。时间流逝后，旧模块自然萎缩：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间</th>\n<th>旧代码占比</th>\n<th>新代码占比</th>\n<th>触发点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Month 0</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>0%</td>\n<td>决策点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Month 3</td>\n<td>85%</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n<td>新 Feature 全部用新架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Month 12</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td>高频旧页面完成迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Month 24</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n<td>85%</td>\n<td>只剩低频遗留页面</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"模式-6-模块提取\">模式 6：模块提取</h3><p>将 monolith 中的一个 Feature 提取为独立模块（Gradle module / SPM package），在提取过程中重构其内部架构：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>识别 Feature 的边界（哪些类属于这个 Feature）</li>\n<li>将这些类移到新模块，编译——修复所有断裂的依赖</li>\n<li>为跨 Feature 的调用引入接口</li>\n<li>在新模块内部重构为目标架构</li>\n<li>删除旧位置的代码</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"迁移中的风险管理\">迁移中的风险管理</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>缓解措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新旧实现行为不一致</td>\n<td>并行运行 + 对比测试（Shadow Mode）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迁移拖延导致双系统长期共存</td>\n<td>设定 Deadline + 定期删除旧代码仪式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队认知分裂（不知道该用新还是旧）</td>\n<td>决策文档 + lint 规则禁止新代码依赖旧模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迁移过程中引入回归 Bug</td>\n<td>先补充遗留代码的 Characterization Test</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Characterization Test</strong>（Michael Feathers 提出）：在重构前先写测试捕捉旧代码的当前行为——不管这个行为是否&quot;正确&quot;。目的是确保重构不改变可观察行为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// Characterization Test：记录旧代码的实际行为&#10;@Test&#10;fun `legacy price calculator applies tax after discount`() {&#10;    val calculator = LegacyPriceCalculator()&#10;    // 先打折再加税（可能是 Bug，但目前用户已习惯）&#10;    val result = calculator.calculate(price = 100.0, discount = 0.1, taxRate = 0.08)&#10;    assertEquals(97.2, result, 0.01) // 100 * 0.9 * 1.08 = 97.2&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Characterization Test：记录旧代码的实际行为</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun `legacy price calculator applies tax after discount`() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val calculator = LegacyPriceCalculator()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 先打折再加税（可能是 Bug，但目前用户已习惯）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val result = calculator.calculate(price = 100.0, discount = 0.1, taxRate = 0.08)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assertEquals(97.2, result, 0.01) // 100 * 0.9 * 1.08 = 97.2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>遗留迁移不是技术债务的一次性清算，而是一个持续运行的过程。它需要 <a href=\"architecture-decision-mobile\">架构决策文档</a> 来记录为什么选择了某种迁移模式，也需要 <a href=\"architecture-testing-strategies\">架构测试策略</a> 来确保迁移过程中不引入回归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>遗留代码迁移的唯一被大规模验证有效的策略是渐进替换——Strangler Fig 模式让新旧架构在过渡期共存，路由层作为切换接缝。六种具体模式（分支抽象、Wrapper 层、UI 渐进替换、数据层先行、特性冻结、模块提取）可以根据项目约束组合使用。Characterization Test 是迁移安全网——在重构前先捕捉旧代码的可观察行为。设定明确的删除旧代码 Deadline 和 lint 规则禁止新代码依赖旧模块，是防止双系统长期共存的治理手段。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"遗留代码迁移模式","id":"遗留代码迁移模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Strangler Fig 模式在移动端的适配","id":"strangler-fig-模式在移动端的适配"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移优先级矩阵","id":"迁移优先级矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"六种渐进迁移模式","id":"六种渐进迁移模式"},{"level":3,"text":"模式 1：分支抽象（Branch by Abstraction）","id":"模式-1-分支抽象-branch-by-abstraction"},{"level":3,"text":"模式 2：Wrapper / Adapter 层","id":"模式-2-wrapper-adapter-层"},{"level":3,"text":"模式 3：UI 层渐进替换","id":"模式-3-ui-层渐进替换"},{"level":3,"text":"模式 4：数据层先行","id":"模式-4-数据层先行"},{"level":3,"text":"模式 5：特性冻结 + 平行开发","id":"模式-5-特性冻结-平行开发"},{"level":3,"text":"模式 6：模块提取","id":"模式-6-模块提取"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移中的风险管理","id":"迁移中的风险管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"架构测试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/practice/architecture-testing-strategies"},"next":{"title":"架构决策与文档化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/practice/architecture-decision-mobile"}}